<!--
  Best-effort sample shaped after BigBlueButton's documented recording metadata.xml format.
  Not captured from a real BBB server - replace with a real sample if available.

  Honesty note (confirmed before building this reader): metadata.xml is meeting-level only -
  id, name, start/end time, participant count. Per-participant join/leave timestamps are NOT
  part of this file; BBB reports those separately in events.xml (its learning-analytics
  export), which this lane does not read. FixtureBbbMeetingMetadataReader therefore returns
  an empty participants list for BBB rather than fabricating join/leave data that metadata.xml
  doesn't actually contain.
-->
<recording>
